[00:00.00]作词 : James Blunt/Mark Batson
[00:01.00]作曲 : James Blunt/Mark Batson
[00:36.23]Simona 西蒙娜
[00:38.93]You're getting older 岁月在你身上流淌
[00:42.70]Your journey's been 人生旅程的印记
[00:45.49]Etched on your skin 已刻在你脸庞
[00:51.74]Simona 西蒙娜
[00:54.57]Wish I had known that 多希望我曾明白
[00:58.26]What seemed so strong 那些看似永恒的时光
[01:02.30]Has been and gone 早已消逝远方
[01:06.85]I would call you up every Saturday night 每个周六夜晚我都会拨通你电话
[01:10.79]And we'd both stay out 'til the morning light 我们彻夜狂欢直到晨光微亮
[01:14.69]And we sang "Here we go again" 齐声唱着"我们又来了"
[01:22.54]And though time goes by 纵使时光飞逝
[01:24.39]I will always be in a club with you in 1973 我永远停留在1973年与你共舞的俱乐部
[01:32.22]Singing "Here we go again" 唱着"我们又来了"
[01:38.62]Simona 西蒙娜
[01:41.41]Wish I was sober 多希望此刻清醒
[01:45.13]So I could see clearly now 就能看清眼前景象
[01:49.19]The rain has gone 雨过天已晴
[01:54.21]Simona 西蒙娜
[01:56.88]I guess it's over 我想一切都已结束
